<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Restaurant Menu Card</title>
</head>
<style>
    *{
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    body{
        background-color: white;
        color: rgb(203, 7, 7);
        
        
    }
    .title{
        text-shadow: 4px 4px maroon;
        font-weight:bolder;
        font-size: 50px;
        font-family: 'Franklin Gothic Medium', 'Arial Narrow', Arial, sans-serif;
        font-style: italic;
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-align: center;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .slogan{
        text-align: center;
        text-decoration: underline;
        font-weight: bold;
    }
    .menu-card{
        width: 400px;
        border: 4px solid maroon;
        border-radius: 20px;
        background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom right, rgb(255, 174, 0), rgb(251, 255, 0));

    }
    .dish-description{
        text-indent: 30px;
        font-size: 12px;
    }
    .dish{
        text-transform: capitalize;

    }
    .discount{
 font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #ffffff;
      background-color: #b22222;
      text-align: center;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 3px #000000;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px #b22222;
      transform: rotate(-2deg);
    }
</style>
<body>
    <div class="menu-card">
<h1 class="title">
        In-N-Out
    </h1>
    <p class="slogan">
        Quality you can taste.
    </p>
    <h2 class="dish">
        Double-Double
    </h2>
    <p class="dish-description">
Two juicy beef patties, melted cheese, fresh vegetables, and signature spread on a toasted bun.
    </p>
    <h2 class="dish">
        Cheeseburger
    </h2>
     <p class="dish-description">
Juicy beef patty with melted cheese, fresh toppings, and signature spread on a toasted bun.
     </p>
    <h2 class="dish">
        Hamburger
    </h2>
     <p class="dish-description">
Fresh beef patty topped with crisp vegetables and signature spread on a toasted bun.
     </p>
    <h2 class="dish">
        French Fries
    </h2>
     <p class="dish-description">
Freshly hand-cut potatoes, cooked until golden and crispy with delicious natural potato flavor.
     </p>
    <h2 class="dish">
        Beverages
    </h2>
     <p class="dish-description">
Refreshing soft drinks, lemonade, iced tea, coffee, milk, and creamy milkshakes for every meal.
     </p>
     <div class="discount">
<p> 20% off  all combos!!!!</p>
     </div>
     
    </div>


    
</body>
</html>
